  "description": "<p data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"136\"><strong data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"134\">Bosch POF 1400 ACE Bovenfrees in Koffer | Nieuw | €129,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"482\">De <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"163\">Bosch POF 1400 ACE</strong> is een krachtige en nauwkeurige bovenfrees, ideaal voor houtbewerking, meubels en precisiewerk. Dankzij de variabele snelheid, ergonomische grip en solide constructie is dit model geschikt voor zowel hobbyisten als professionals. Dit exemplaar is <strong data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"420\">nieuw</strong>, geleverd in originele koffer en direct klaar voor gebruik.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"503\"><strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"501\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<li data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"506\" data-end=\"519\">Merk: Bosch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"543\">\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"543\">Model: POF 1400 ACE</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\">Vermogen: 1400 W</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"610\">Toerental: 11.000 – 28.000 tpm (variabel)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"611\" data-end=\"641\">\r\n<p data-start=\"613\" data-end=\"641\">Diepte-instelling: 0–55 mm</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"674\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"674\">Behuizing: Robuust kunststof</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"714\">\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"714\">Handgreep: Ergonomisch met softgrip</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"758\">Inclusief: Koffer voor veilig transport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"778\">\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"778\">Toestand: Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"797\"><strong data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"795\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<li data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<p data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"831\">Bosch POF 1400 ACE bovenfrees</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"852\">Originele koffer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"877\">\r\n<p data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"877\">Standaard toebehoren</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"894\"><strong data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"892\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<li data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"938\">Krachtige 1400W motor voor precisiewerk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"970\">\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"970\">Variabele snelheidsregeling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"1019\">\r\n<p data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1019\">Ergonomisch ontwerp voor comfortabel gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1020\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1075\">Compacte en stevige koffer voor opslag en transport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1133\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1133\">Geschikt voor houtbewerking, meubel- en decoratiewerk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1156\"><strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1144\">Prijs</strong><br data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1147\">€129,99</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1287\"><strong data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1182\">Ophalen of verzenden</strong><br data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1185\">Afhalen bij <strong data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1226\">Used Products Spijkenisse</strong>. Verzending mogelijk; zorgvuldig verpakt en snel geleverd.</p>",
